lower -> left_half : "no"
right_half -> more [route=elbow beginpt=n endpt=e]
left_half -> more [route=elbow beginpt=e endpt=e]
about: text "Binary search: find an item in a sorted list by checking the middle and throwing away the half it can't be in. Takes about log2(n) checks, so a million items need about 20. Use it on any sorted data." @ 16,206 178x13 [in=bsearch]

