again -> done : "no"
about_2: text "Bubble sort: walk the list swapping neighbours that are out of order, until a whole pass swaps nothing. Simple but slow (n² comparisons), so it is used for teaching and tiny lists only." @ 16,449 178x13 [in=bubble]

