rule_8: text "Place a queen in each row, trying each column. If a row has no safe square, go back a row and move that queen on. This is the first full answer." @ 274,3641 76x44 [in=queens]
about_30: text "Backtracking: build a solution one choice at a time, and undo the last choice as soon as it can't work. Used for puzzles like Sudoku and N-queens, timetabling and searching all combinations." @ 206,3697 144x17 [in=queens]

