right_2: process "45    50" @ 302,4405 40x12 [in=btree]
note_8: text "Each node holds sorted keys, and one more child than keys. 30 is between 20 and 40: the middle child." @ 202,4425 140x12 [in=btree]
root_3 -> left_2 : "< 20"
root_3 -> middle : "20 – 40"
root_3 -> right_2 : "> 40"
about_39: text "B-tree: a search tree whose nodes hold many sorted keys, so it is short and wide and a search reads only a few nodes. Nodes split as they fill. Behind almost every database index and file system." @ 202,4443 140x17 [in=btree]

